WEBVTT

00:00.520 --> 00:05.680
Come with me to reinforce the west to prevent anyone from taking advantage and coordinating with the Wuzhao to seize the gates.

00:05.800 --> 00:07.200
I accept the order.

00:12.000 --> 00:25.000
You rushed with your men to the West Gate. After guarding it on high alert for a long while without any sign of enemy presence, thunderous battle cries suddenly erupted from the East Gate—Shi Lang's main army had already breached the city.

00:26.600 --> 00:32.400
Brother-in-law, hurry the south grain depot is on fire Yiyang can't be held shut up they're going to run.

00:32.520 --> 00:38.280
Even Prince of Jin is running the Wuzhao are coming retreat quickly stop hurry.

00:38.360 --> 00:41.120
Stop stop.

00:46.000 --> 00:56.000
Street fighting raged fiercely. Vastly outnumbered, the defenders retreated to the inner keep. Shi Lang shattered the gates with fire arrows, and Yiyang finally fell.

